    ('23002', 0, $$Once upon a time, there lived three best friends; Jude, Becky and Rachael.$$),
    ('23002', 1, $$They always did their house chores together; they actually went to each other's homes and helped each other.$$),
    ('23002', 2, $$Their parents were so pleased with them.$$),
    ('23002', 3, $$One day, they went to the well, and spent a very long time there. They forgot that it was getting late. The games they were playing were just to nice to help them remember that they had to go home.$$),
    ('23002', 4, $$They even forgot about the warning they had been given about what always happened when one left the well late... Can you guess what the warning was?$$),
    ('23002', 5, $$It's only when people started to leave the well one by one, that they remembered that it was getting late and they needed to go home as well.$$),
    ('23002', 6, $$However, on their way home, grass covered them up!$$),
    ('23002', 7, $$As they were still struggling to get out, it completely engulfed them! And they totally disappeared!$$),
    ('23002', 8, $$Early in the morning, one of the village women went to the well to fetch water.$$),
    ('23002', 9, $$She helped them get out of the entangled grass. And immediately took them to the village local council. And everyone was excited to see them.$$),
    ('23015', 0, $$Milka and John are playing in the garden.$$),
    ('23015', 1, $$In the morning, Milka gets up early to take a bath.$$),
    ('23015', 2, $$Once she grows up and graduates school, Milka dreams to build a beautiful house for her and her family.$$),
    ('23015', 3, $$Milka listens carefully to her teacher.$$),
    ('23015', 4, $$When she arrives at home, her mother prepares lunch. Milka likes meat, rice, fruit salad and milk. Her little brother likes meat too and has a good appetite. The mother is proud of her daughter's education.$$),
    ('23015', 5, $$After lunch Milka does not rest, she helps her little brother to do home activities.$$),
    ('23015', 6, $$After supper, Milka quickly goes to do the homework. Her friend Marina helps her to revise her notes. She is used to read until midnight while others are deep in sleep.$$),
    ('23015', 7, $$Milka always takes the first place in class.$$),
    ('23015', 8, $$After school completion Milka got a good job because of her good education and skills. Later she can fulfill her dream of buying a beautiful house. Her little brother and mother enjoy Milka's new house. Her little brother promises his Mother to complete school too.$$),
    ('23015', 9, $$To celebrate one year at work, Milka prepares a one year aniversary. Her friend Marina, other neighbors and her family are invited. She gives testimony on how she completed her studies.$$),
    ('23064', 0, $$Being in the kitchen is not only about putting pots on a fire.$$),
    ('23064', 1, $$It begins with gathering clean pots and cooking tools.$$),
    ('23064', 2, $$Then you collect vegetables, grains, and sauces.$$),
    ('23064', 3, $$The cooking begins with boiling some water.$$),
    ('23064', 4, $$You cut, dice and slice the vegetables.$$),
    ('23064', 5, $$You wash and clean up the chopped vegetables and get ready to cook.$$),
    ('23064', 6, $$You put the pot on fire and let it heat up.$$),
    ('23064', 7, $$You put the vegetables in the pot of boiling water and let them cook.$$),
    ('23064', 8, $$You set the table while the vegetables cook.$$),
    ('23064', 9, $$After setting the table, you taste the vegetables for salt.$$),
    ('23064', 10, $$You serve the vegetables on clean plates.$$),
    ('23064', 11, $$When you have eaten, you wash the dishes and put them away.$$),
    ('23116', 0, $$In the forest, the little elephant was walking with his mother and his older sister. They were walking and singing loudly. Unfortunately the little elephant squeezed his foot on a stone and he stopped and laid at the roadside.$$),
    ('23116', 1, $$His mother and his sister continued and did not recognized that they left him behind.$$),
    ('23116', 2, $$By chance, Panda was eating near the place where the Little Elephant was resting.$$),
    ('23116', 3, $$At his arrival in the city, everyone showed different emotions and reactions.$$),
    ('23116', 4, $$The king Lion did not agree that the Little Elephant should stay in the city and said:$$),
    ('23116', 5, $$The Little Elephant was shocked and scared. He did not have much to say and he left.$$),
